# 🎨 Internship Matching Platform — Design System & UI/UX Specification (design.md)

> **Design Direction:** Retro-Chunky Neo-Brutalism & Playful Illustrated EdTech  
> **Target Audience:** Gen-Z University Students (Undergraduates / Interns) & Modern Tech / Startup Recruiters  
> **Form Factor:** Mobile-first viewport (`390px` – `430px`, max-width `448px`), iOS/Android compliant touch targets.

---

## 1. 🌈 Design Foundations & Philosophy

### 1.1 Core Principles
1. **Playful yet Purposeful (ขี้เล่นแต่จริงจัง):** Combining chunky retro pop illustration with clear recruitment ergonomics. Information must never be obscured by novelty.
2. **Hard Surfaces & Physical Tactility:** No soft Gaussian blurs or subtle drop shadows. Instead, we use solid black outlines (`2px` – `3.5px`) with hard `3px 3px 0px #18181B` offset shadows that depress on tap.
3. **Warm Paper Canvas:** Ditching sterile pure white `#FFFFFF` backgrounds in favor of warm creamy tones (`#FDF8EE` / `#FFFBEB`) mimicking zines, indie comic prints, and retro Japanese editorial layouts.
4. **Instant Scannability:** Pill badges, color-coded status chips, bold emoji stickers, and oversized numerals for stipends and match percentages.

