## 3. ✍️ Typography & Elevation Rules

### 3.1 Typography
- **Heading / Display Font:** Serif / Grotesk Display (`font-serif` / `Clash Display` / `Cooper Black` style fallback) with `font-black` weights.
- **Body & Numerical Font:** Clean Geometric Sans (`Inter` / `Plus Jakarta Sans` / `Noto Sans Thai` for bilingual support).
- **Scale:**
  - `Hero / Title`: `24px` – `32px` (Line height: `1.15`, letter-spacing: `-0.03em`)
  - `Section Header`: `18px` – `20px` (Weight: `900`)
  - `Card Title / Item`: `14px` – `15px` (Weight: `800`)
  - `Body / Descriptions`: `12px` – `13px` (Weight: `500`, Line height: `1.5`)
  - `Micro / Badges / Timestamps`: `10px` – `11px` (Weight: `800`, uppercase tracking)

### 3.2 Elevation & Shadow Elevation Matrix
```css
/* Chunky Neo-Brutalist CSS Rules */
--border-standard: 2.5px solid #18181B;
--border-thin: 1.5px solid #18181B;
--border-thick: 3.5px solid #18181B;

/* Elevation 1 (Chips / Badges) */
box-shadow: 1.5px 1.5px 0px #18181B;

/* Elevation 2 (Cards / Inputs / Buttons) */
box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #18181B;

/* Elevation 3 (Device Frame / Floating Panels) */
box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #18181B;

/* Active Pressed Effect */
transform: translate(2px, 2px);
box-shadow: 1px 1px 0px #18181B;
```

