## 5. 📱 Screen Specifications (18 Screens + 1 Filter Sheet)

### Part 1: Common & Authentication (3 Screens)

```
[Splash Screen] ──────────► [Login Screen] ──────────► [Register Screen]
  - Illustrated Hero          - Student / Company Tab     - Student vs Recruiter Cards
  - Value Prop Tagline        - Google 1-Tap CTA          - Fast Onboarding
```

#### 1. Splash Screen
- **Visuals:** Large retro rocket sticker `🚀`, wavy decorative underlines, contrast CTA.
- **Actions:** "Get Started" (routes to Login) and "Explore As Guest 👋" (direct to Student Feed).

#### 2. Login Screen
- **Role Segmented Control:** Segmented pill toggle `[ 🎓 Student ]` vs `[ 🏢 Company ]`.
- **Fields:** Email, Password with show/hide, Remember Me checkbox, and Google social login button.

#### 3. Register Screen
- **Role Selector Cards:** Side-by-side selectable chunky cards (Student looking for internships vs Recruiter posting positions).
- **Inputs:** Full name, School/Company domain email, password.

---

### Part 2: Student Flow (9 Screens + 1 Filter Sheet)

#### 4. Job Feed & Home Screen
- **Header:** Sticky top header with user avatar, greeting, and notification bell with unread indicator dot.
- **Quick Banners:** 2 chunky promotional cards (`25K+ Stipend Tech` & `18K+ Creative Design`).
- **Search Bar & Filter Trigger:** Search input with instant clear button + dedicated filter slider trigger.
- **Category Chips:** Horizontal scroller (`All`, `Design`, `Software`, `Marketing`, `Data`).
- **Job Cards Feed:**
  - Company logo with background accent.
  - Position title, company name, relative post date (`2d ago`).
  - Stipend badge (`💰 18,000 THB`) and location badge (`Hybrid / Bangkok`).
  - Bookmark toggle button with active state persistence.

#### 4.1 Filter Bottom Sheet (Overlay)
- Accessible from Home Feed search bar.
- Filters:
  - **Work Format:** `All`, `Hybrid`, `Remote`, `Onsite` chips.
  - **Job Category:** Grid selector.
  - **Stipend Toggle:** "มีเบี้ยเลี้ยงเท่านั้น (Paid Only)" toggle switch.
- Action Buttons: `Clear All` (Outline) and `Apply Filter (X Results)` (Primary Indigo).

#### 5. Job Detail Screen
- **Hero Card:** Position name, company header, duration badge, stipend highlight.
- **Stat Cards:** 2-column metrics (Application Deadline & Response Rate ~2-3 Days).
- **Content Sections:** Role Overview, Bulleted Requirements with green checkmarks, and Benefits tags.
- **Sticky Footer Bar:** Bookmark button + "Apply Now (ใช้เรซูเม่นี้)" action button.

#### 6. Saved Jobs Screen
- Filtered view of all bookmarked internships.
- Card includes quick stipend summary, remove action, and 1-tap redirect to application flow.
- Empty state with cute bookmark illustration.

#### 7. Student Profile Screen
- **Profile Header Card:** Custom avatar emoji with edit button, university, faculty, year, and GPA pill.
- **Bio Section:** Editable statement with playful copy.
- **Skills Tag Cloud:** Removable skill pills + inline text input with "+ Add" to dynamically append new skills.
- **Active Resume Preview Card:** Quick glance at the active PDF name, file size, and upload date with quick edit CTA.
- **Portfolio Links:** External links for Behance, GitHub, and LinkedIn.

#### 8. Resume Upload Screen
- **Upload Dropzone:** Dashed 3px border container with upload icon.
- **Auto-Parser Badge:** "Auto-Parses Skills & GPA".
- **Current Resume Card:** File preview with file size, modified date, "Replace PDF", and "Delete" actions.

#### 9. Apply Job Screen
- **Recap Card:** Target position and company summary.
- **Applicant Data Check:** Pre-filled student name, university, and attached PDF resume name.
- **Cover Statement Textarea:** Pre-filled contextual draft with prompt helper `[+ Insert Availability]`.
- **CTA:** "Confirm & Send Application 🚀".

#### 10. My Applications Screen
- **Status Filter Tabs:** `All`, `In Review`, `Interview`, `Accepted`.
- **Application List Item:** Company avatar, position, status chip with distinct colors, applied date, and link to detailed timeline.

#### 11. Application Detail (Sequential Step Timeline)
- Step-by-step progress tracking component:
  1. *Application Submitted* (Date, attached assets)
  2. *Application In Review* (Reviewing recruiter name)
  3. *Interview Call* (Current step indicator with date & time)
  4. *Final Result* (Pending / Offer status)
- Recruiter contact box with "Send Message" action.

#### 12. Notifications Screen
- Activity stream showing company actions (viewed application, interview invitations, algorithm match alerts).
- Unread indicator dots and "Mark all read" quick action.

---

### Part 3: Company / Recruiter Flow (6 Screens)

#### 13. Company Dashboard
- **Metric Cards (2x2 Grid):**
  - *Active Roles* (`4`)
  - *Applicants* (`38`)
  - *Pending Review* (`9`)
  - *Shortlisted* (`6`)
- **Quick Action CTA:** "Post New Job" button.
- **Recent Candidates List:** Direct access to review incoming applicants.

#### 14. Company Profile Screen
- Company avatar, verified partner badge, industry tags, office location, official careers URL, and recruiter leads.

#### 15. Manage Jobs Screen
- List of open job postings with status indicators (`Active` vs `Closed`), total candidate count pill, and edit/delete actions.

#### 16. Create / Edit Job Form
- Structured inputs:
  - Position Name / Job Title
  - Format (Dropdown: `Hybrid`, `Onsite`, `Remote`)
  - Stipend Amount (`THB/Month`)
  - Description & Responsibilities
  - Duration & Location
- Publish button with validation feedback.

#### 17. Applicants List Screen
- Candidate cards ranked with match percentages (`96% Match`, `89% Match`).
- Candidate university, faculty, applied timestamp, and extracted top skills.
- Status tag showing current pipeline step.

#### 18. Applicant Detail & Reviewer
- Full student dossier with GPA and match score badge.
- Candidate cover note quote box.
- Embedded resume PDF viewer preview with download action.
- Internal Recruiter Notes textarea.
- **Sticky Pipeline Action Bar:** 4 quick buttons to transition candidate status:
  - `[ Shortlist ]`
  - `[ Interview ]`
  - `[ Accept 🎉 ]`
  - `[ Reject ]`

