## 6. 🛠️ Interactive Dev Prototype Navigator
An omnipresent floating dev toolbar is positioned at the top of the mobile frame for seamless design reviews and stakeholder presentations:
- Displays current active screen key and active user role (`Student` vs `Company`).
- Categorized 1-tap jump buttons across all 18 screens.
- One-click access to the modal Filter Bottom Sheet.

---

## 7. 📐 Responsive & Touch Ergonomics
- **Minimum Tap Target:** `44px` height on all buttons, tabs, and interactive chips.
- **Safe Area Insets:** Padding account for mobile home indicator bars (`pb-20` on bottom navigation views).
- **Z-Index System:**
  - `z-10`: Interactive cards and badges.
  - `z-30`: Sticky bottom navigation bars.
  - `z-40`: Sticky action drawers (Job Detail CTA, Candidate Review Bar).
  - `z-50`: Modals, filter bottom sheets, and system toast notifications.